{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Reach Out — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for gentle, whole-person guidance. Memberships, intake, and educational resources—get in touch to learn more." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --accent:#6a9a7a;
      --muted:#6b7280;
      --bg1:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4fbf7 0%,#eef7ff 100%);
      --card:#ffffff;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(12,20,14,0.08);
      --radius:18px;
      --max-width:1100px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      color:#102a1f;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background:var(--bg1);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      color:var(--accent);
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:40px 20px;
    }
    .wrap{
      width:100%;
      max-width:var(--max-width);
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(250,252,250,0.95));
      border-radius:24px;
      overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 420px;
      gap:0;
      position:relative;
    }
    /* diagonal split using pseudo element */
    .wrap::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background: url('assets/img/pattern.svg') repeat, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(106,154,122,0.06), rgba(102,126,234,0.02));
      mix-blend-mode:overlay;
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    header{
      grid-column:1 / -1;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      padding:22px 28px;
      gap:12px;
      background:transparent;
      position:relative;
      z-index:2;
    }
    .brand{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:var(--accent);
    }
    .brand .logo{
      width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%, #eaf7ec 100%);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#2b5a3f;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(45,72,56,0.08);
    }
    nav{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    nav a{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(106,154,122,0.06);color:var(--accent)}
    nav a.active{background:rgba(106,154,122,0.12);color:var(--accent)}

    .left{
      padding:46px 40px 56px 56px;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(245,250,249,0.9));
      position:relative;
      z-index:2;
      min-height:560px;
    }
    .right{
      padding:48px 34px;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f9fff7, #f4fbf7);
      clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
      border-left:1px solid rgba(16,42,31,0.04);
    }

    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.06;color:#143622}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 20px 0;color:var(--muted);max-width:44ch}

    .contact-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(18,44,36,0.06);}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:#2c4f39}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,40,30,0.08);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row .col{flex:1}
    .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);}

    .btn-primary{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;border:none;font-weight:600}
    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(106,154,122,0.12);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    .meta{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    .info-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}
    .info-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .info-item strong{display:block;color:#214a37}

    .cta-box{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(106,154,122,0.06),rgba(106,154,122,0.03));border:1px solid rgba(106,154,122,0.08)}

    footer{grid-column:1/-1;padding:22px 28px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:920px){
      .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .right{clip-path:none;border-left:none}
      body{padding:24px}
    }
    @media (max-width:520px){
      header{padding:14px}
      .left{padding:28px}
      .right{padding:22px}
      h1{font-size:22px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap" role="main">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">H</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:#163b2c">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Philosophy</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Memberships</a>
        <a href="about.html">Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="active">Reach</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="left" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <h1 id="contact-heading">Let's start a gentle conversation</h1>
      <p class="lead">If you've been curious about a whole-person approach—be it stress, sleep, digestion, or persistent low energy—reach out. We listen first, educate, and work with you to build steady, realistic steps. Membership options provide ongoing support and education.</p>

      <div class="contact-card" aria-hidden="false">
        <form id="contact-form" method="post" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Ava Jordan" required />
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="{{PHONE}}" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />

          <label for="reason">What would you like to discuss?</label>
          <select id="reason" name="reason">
            <option>New patient / intake</option>
            <option>Membership inquiry</option>
            <option>Follow-up</option>
            <option>Labs / educational consult</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>

          <label for="message">A few details (symptoms, goals, timeline)</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Briefly describe what you're experiencing or hoping to change..."></textarea>

          <label style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center"><input type="checkbox" name="membership_interest" /> I'm interested in learning about membership options</label>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
            <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" class="btn-ghost">Email us</a>
          </div>

          <div class="meta">By contacting us you consent to receive a reply. We do not offer guaranteed cures—our focus is education, collaboration, and whole-person care. If this is an emergency, please call local emergency services.</div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:start">
        <div style="flex:1">
          <div class="small">Hours</div>
          <div style="font-weight:600">Mon–Fri 9:00am–5:00pm</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1">
          <div class="small">Phone</div>
          <div style="font-weight:600"><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>

    <aside class="right" aria-labelledby="office-heading">
      <h2 id="office-heading" style="margin-top:0;color:#163b2c">Visit &amp; connect</h2>
      <p class="small">We work with members and one-time consults. Many visits are available virtually; optional educational labs are discussed during intake.</p>

      <div class="info-grid" style="margin-top:14px">
        <div class="info-item">
          <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(26,61,44,0.06);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">📍</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Office</strong>
            <div class="muted">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • By appointment</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(26,61,44,0.06);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">✉️</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Email</strong>
            <div class="muted"><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(26,61,44,0.06);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">👩‍⚕️</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Clinician</strong>
            <div class="muted">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-box">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:#184d38">Memberships for steady support</div>
            <div class="muted">Ongoing check-ins, educational resources, and priority scheduling.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn-primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">
        <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px">What to expect</div>
        <div>We begin with listening and a thoughtful intake to understand your story. Follow-ups emphasize education, lifestyle adjustments, and, when appropriate, optional lab testing as tools—not guarantees.</div>
      </div>

    </aside>

    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Care rooted in curiosity and compassion</div>
        <div class="muted">Need immediate help? Call {{PHONE}} or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Basic client-side validation and subtle UX enhancements.
    (function(){
      var form=document.getElementById('contact-form');
      if(!form) return;
      form.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
        // gentle client-side check
        var name=form.querySelector('#name').value.trim();
        var email=form.querySelector('#email').value.trim();
        if(!name || !email){
          e.preventDefault();
          alert('Please provide your name and email so we can follow up.');
        }
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — the contact/Reach page for the holistic medicine site.

Purpose & notes:
- This chunk provides the contact page layout designed for a split-diagonal aesthetic.
- The page is intentionally warm, conversational, and emphasizes education and whole-person support (no guaranteed cures or medical promises).
- Membership options are presented as an ongoing supportive model; the primary CTA and URL are placeholders: {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.
- The page references an SVG background pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg. The actual SVG asset is handled in another chunk; the CSS uses it as a repeating overlay for visual texture.

Placeholders to replace in your build pipeline:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{CREDENTIALS}}

Accessibility & behavior:
- The form includes client-side checks for name and email and a mailto fallback link.
- Clear, readable contrast and responsive behavior are provided in CSS (grid collapses on small screens).

Integration tips:
- Provide the assets/img/pattern.svg file (unique SVG pattern) in the assets folder for the textured background.
- Hook the form action ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}) to your form handling or membership signup endpoint.
- Ensure server-side validation of form inputs and privacy handling consistent with local regulations.

Voice & design intent:
- Warm storyteller tone with a gentle call to conversation rather than promises of cure.
- Visual richness via gradients, subtle shadows, and a repeating SVG pattern—no external fonts or CDNs used.

End of chunk 4."}
BUNDLE_END
